      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"My friends, we stand on the bedrock of tradition, a way of life forged by generations of hard-won wisdom. To invite change so sudden, so disruptive, is to unravel the very fabric of our cherished community. We must defend the established order, not out of malice, but out of a profound respect for the distinct character and institutions that make this Southern home what it is.\"",
